    "description": "Zenless Zone Zero is an urban fantasy action RPG set in New Eridu, the last city standing after supernatural disasters called Hollows swallowed the world. Play as a Proxy — the legendary duo Phaethon — guiding a roster of Agents through shifting Hollows in fast, stylish real-time combat built around dodges, parries, chain attacks and attribute anomalies. Outside the Hollows you run a video store, befriend your Agents, raise Bangboo companions and dive into a pulpy story of interdimensional intrigue, all wrapped in a street-culture art style and a collectible Signal Search gacha."
